{"page":20148,"part":1,"text":"笔势\n\n\n笔势\n\n下笔之初，有搭锋者，有折锋者。其一字之体，定于初下笔。凡作字，第一字多是折锋，第二、三字承上笔势，多是搭锋。若一字之间，右边多是折锋，应其左故也。又有平起者，如隶画；藏锋者，如篆画。大要折搭多精神，平藏善含蓄，兼之则妙矣。","eligible":true,"blockedReasons":[],"source":{"kind":"human-txt","page":20148,"part":1,"label":"wolai标准正文／原人工审核独有补充","verifiedBy":"项目负责人（本对话确认）","verifiedAt":"2026-10-22T07:57:06+00:00","revision":"3f5847ef9f2e53471e728d245b72e3cc37039275b6d6ed424d171aac044b81d3","textSha256":"3f5847ef9f2e53471e728d245b72e3cc37039275b6d6ed424d171aac044b81d3","fileSha256":"3f5847ef9f2e53471e728d245b72e3cc37039275b6d6ed424d171aac044b81d3","txtPath":"annotation-data/wolai-txt/20148-work-119.txt","reviewCsvPath":"annotation-data/wolai-review.csv","standardCorpus":"wolai-standard","displayLabel":"续书谱 · 笔势","sourceUrl":"https://www.wolai.com/mojiyi/kFfK8Dci4xmDsTtkMbtjRq","originalPages":[405],"positionStatus":"原图只作篇目参考；新版正文不声称与旧扫描逐字对齐","provenance":[{"start":0,"end":3,"sourceTextSha256":"32cb3ee38a717a8336482384536aba014bfca49f7716b15bf906670021ae6702","id":"local-405-152-161","page_id":405,"origin":"legacy-reviewed-txt","rawStart":152,"rawEnd":161,"reviewedTextSha256":"cd15ec8cb619cb9a383f769eabf49e10de431385d920616c4e35a8900e9901e3","displayUnitOrigins":[[158,159],[159,160],[160,161]],"legacySource":{"kind":"human-txt","page":405,"part":2,"label":"人工审核原TXT","verifiedBy":"郑雨荻","verifiedAt":"2026-10-19T14:16:28.709Z","revision":"cd15ec8cb619cb9a383f769eabf49e10de431385d920616c4e35a8900e9901e3","textSha256":"cd15ec8cb619cb9a383f769eabf49e10de431385d920616c4e35a8900e9901e3","fileSha256":"a7959b8ad3ac4b1328d4afcc5960761834bc9dbc83e2ea2d0c51808b9658a61c","txtPath":"tasks/2026-10-21-review-package-update/extracted/member-2-part-2/第2份-逐页校勘.txt","reviewCsvPath":"tasks/2026-10-21-review-package-update/extracted/member-2-part-2/第2份-TXT校验表.csv","reviewJsonPath":"tasks/2026-10-21-review-package-update/extracted/member-2-part-2/第2份-初筛进度备份.json"}},{"start":5,"end":7,"sourceTextSha256":"53cdca405eeef3ac6b5604d3047078ff30a0db6ef0c89b80679a22cf8e5a